   "note": "The common blue module with a regulator and level shifter (runs from 5 V), header on the top short edge: CS SCK MOSI MISO VCC GND left to right. Pin order and size from one parts file; some sellers print the pins in another order, so read yours (Pin labels lets you type them). Mounting holes not included."
