   "note": "SSD1306 module, board 27.3 x 27.8 mm, 4-pin header centred on the top edge, pins GND VCC SCL SDA left to right as you look at the screen. Some sellers swap VCC and GND: read the print on yours and use Pin labels > VCC GND SCL SDA. Mounted screen-up on the component side it is shown as is; to have the screen face the other way (under the board), Shift+M. The four mounting holes differ between sellers and are not included."
