   "note": "Seeed's own footprint: 2 x 7 at 2.54 mm, rows 15.24 mm apart, USB-C at the top (shown as a box). D0=GPIO2 D1=3 D2=4 D3=5 D4/SDA=6 D5/SCL=7 D6/TX=21 D7/RX=20 D8/SCK=8 D9/MISO=9 D10/MOSI=10. Castellated: with deadbug pads (Pads of this part > Deadbug) you can solder it flat on the copper, or Shift+M to mirror it so it sits on the copper side. The pads under the board (battery, JTAG) are not included."
